// Promo card for Day One (dayone-sim.app), Brett's reentry simulator — the
// interactive companion to the site's subject. Used on the homepage and the
// Reentry Realities section. Self-contained; no props.
---

<a
  href="https://dayone-sim.app"
  target="_blank"
  rel="noopener"
  class="group block rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-6 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-ochre md:p-7"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:gap-8">
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <p class="eyebrow">Interactive companion</p>
      <h3 class="title-display mt-2 text-2xl transition-colors group-hover:text-ochre">Day One</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-muted">
        A phone-first reentry simulator: live the first ninety days after release — an ID, housing,
        work — one weekly turn at a time. Built by a returning citizen, so the barriers are
        remembered, not imagined.
      </p>
    </div>
    <span class="btn shrink-0">Play Day One →</span>
  </div>
